<title>UK: UK approves GEC's Phoenix project.</title>
<headline>UK approves GEC's Phoenix project.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's defence ministry on Monday said it approved the development by GEC Marconi of the unmanned spy plane, Phoenix.</p>
<p>The ministry said it had confidence in the cost effectiveness, technical performance and reliability of the system to meet the army's requirements.</p>
</text>
